# Supply-chain hygiene (see vault Claude/Preferences.md → Project Initialization).
# Set during the 2026 npm campaign (Miasma/Red Hat wave ~Jun 1-4 2026).

# Block install-time lifecycle scripts (preinstall/postinstall/binding.gyp) —
# the mechanism every recent compromise in this campaign rode on.
ignore-scripts=true

# Resolve only versions published before the latest wave settled (~7 days behind).
# Drop this line once the campaign is no longer active.
before=2026-06-08
